1
00:00:14,21 --> 00:00:16,37
We're running low on resumes.
瑞秋,履歷表已用完了

2
00:00:16,58 --> 00:00:19,34
You want a job with Popular Mechanics?
你真想到「大眾技工」上班嗎?

3
00:00:19,55 --> 00:00:23,57
If you're gonna work for mechanics, those are the ones.
如果你真想為技工工作 那兒倒兒可試試

4
00:00:23,99 --> 00:00:28,65
Guys,I'm going for anything here. I can't be a waitress anymore.
各位,我什麼都得試試 我不能再當服務生了

5
00:00:28,86 --> 00:00:33,99
I'm sick of the lousy tips. I'm sick of being called "Excuse Me."
我是說真的我已厭倦微薄小費 我已厭倦別人對我說「麻煩一下」

6
00:00:34,73 --> 00:00:38,39
-Paper cut! Paper cut! -Here.
-裁紙刀!裁紙刀! -這裡

7
00:00:40,94 --> 00:00:43,73
Grapefruit juice! Grapefruit juice!
柚子汁!柚子汁!

8
00:00:44,71 --> 00:00:47,87
Okay,we're almost done. Only 20 more to go.
差不多搞定了.只剩20份了

9
00:00:48,08 --> 00:00:52,67
-Rach,did you proofread these? -Yeah. Why?
-瑞秋,這些你已校對過? -對,有問題嗎?

10
00:00:53,18 --> 00:00:57,88
Nothing. I'm sure they'll be impressed with your "compuper" skills.
沒事,他們對你的「墊腦」技巧一定會印象深刻的

11
00:00:58,25 --> 00:01:03,19
Oh,my God! Do you think it's on all of them?
糟了,每一份上面都這樣嗎?

12
00:01:06,46 --> 00:01:10,12
No,I'm sure the Xerox machine caught a few.
沒有,影印機弄掉一些了

13
00:01:19,71 --> 00:01:21,83
The One With the Poker
六人行 第1季 第18集 玩撲克

14
00:01:23,96 --> 00:01:30,00
-=BT之家DRM小組 http://bbs.btbbt.com=- 榮譽出品 河馬根據網絡字幕微調製作

15
00:02:09,32 --> 00:02:14,76
They call this a love seat but I'm not feeling anything special towards you.
他們把這裡叫做情侶座. 可是和你對面一點感覺都沒有

16
00:02:24,74 --> 00:02:26,50
-Hey,guys. -Hey.
-嗨,小伙子們 -嗨

17
00:02:27,51 --> 00:02:29,10
Hi,ladies.
嗨,小姐們

18
00:02:29,31 --> 00:02:32,77
Can I get you anything? Did you bring the mail?
需要什麼嗎?信件帶來了沒?

19
00:02:32,98 --> 00:02:37,28
-Lots of responses. -Really? Sure,we have scones left!
-很多回復 -當然?我們這兒當然有烤餅

20
00:02:37,89 --> 00:02:38,88
Read them.
快念給我聽

21
00:02:39,09 --> 00:02:43,65
"Dear Miss Greene: Thank you for your inquiry. However"
親愛的格林小姐感謝您的詢問,然而…

22
00:02:44,49 --> 00:02:50,26
-We have apple cinnamon -"Dear Ms. Greene...." Yeah,yeah! No.
-我們有蘋果肉桂…-親愛的格林小姐…好，好，不行.

23
00:02:53,07 --> 00:02:55,43
-What? -Your Visa bill is huge!
-怎麼了?-你的開銷不小呀

24
00:02:56,77 --> 00:02:57,93
Give me that.
給我

25
00:02:58,41 --> 00:03:01,57
Linda's great. Why won't you go out with her?
我真不敢相信 琳達那麼好你為何不再和她約會?

26
00:03:01,78 --> 00:03:04,07
-I don't know. -ls this about her...
-我也不知道 -是因為她說了

27
00:03:04,28 --> 00:03:07,58
... "The Flintstones could have really happened" thing?
石頭族真有可能發生?

28
00:03:07,78 --> 00:03:12,41
It's not just that. I want someone who does something for me...
不只是因為那樣 因為我要一個能讓我有感覺

29
00:03:12,62 --> 00:03:14,61
...who gets my heart pounding.
能讓我心跳加速

30
00:03:15,72 --> 00:03:17,69
Who makes me....
讓我…

31
00:03:19,33 --> 00:03:22,32
Little playthings with yarn?
感情經驗豐富的女人

32
00:03:23,40 --> 00:03:24,76
What?
什麼?

33
00:03:24,97 --> 00:03:27,80
Could you want her more?
你不是渴望著她?

34
00:03:28,24 --> 00:03:29,23
Who?
誰?

35
00:03:29,44 --> 00:03:32,93
Dee,the sarcastic sister from What's Happening!!.
明蒂,《發生何事》中 那個尖酸刻薄的女孩

36
00:03:40,38 --> 00:03:43,15
Look,I'm totally over her.
我早就忘了她,行嗎?

37
00:03:43,35 --> 00:03:44,65
-Hi! -Coffee?
-好啊! -咖啡?

38
00:03:44,85 --> 00:03:47,34
-No,we're fine. -Okay.
-我們很好 -好的

39
00:03:52,76 --> 00:03:55,79
-Shut up! -We're not saying anything.
-閉嘴! -我們什麼都沒說

40
00:03:56,00 --> 00:03:58,63
-What? -Joey cried last night.
-什麼? -昨晚喬伊哭了

41
00:03:59,93 --> 00:04:03,30
-Thank you. -We were playing poker
 -謝謝 -我們正在玩撲克牌

42
00:04:03,50 --> 00:04:07,77
There was chocolate on the three. It looked like an eight.
三點上有巧克力看起來像是八點

43
00:04:07,98 --> 00:04:11,43
You should have seen him. "Read them and weep!"
可惜你沒看到 他說「準備痛哭流涕吧」

44
00:04:11,65 --> 00:04:13,48
And then he did.
結果哭的是他

45
00:04:14,68 --> 00:04:18,48
Now,how come you guys have never played poker with us?
你們怎麼沒和我們玩過撲克牌?

46
00:04:18,69 --> 00:04:22,78
Yeah,what is that? Like some kind of sexist guy thing?
對,為什麼? 好像這是有性別歧視的男人的專利

47
00:04:22,99 --> 00:04:27,16
-It's poker,so only guys can play? -No. Women can play.
-這是撲克,只有男人才玩?  -才怪,女生也歡迎加人

48
00:04:27,36 --> 00:04:32,13
Then,what is it? Some kind of,like, some kind of,you know
那麼為什麼…這樣的一些,為什麼

49
00:04:32,33 --> 00:04:34,32
All right,what is it?
到底為什麼?

50
00:04:35,84 --> 00:04:37,96
There are just no women in our game.
只是剛好女生沒加入罷了

51
00:04:38,17 --> 00:04:41,97
We just don't know any women who know how to play poker.
 對,我們剛好找不到會玩的女生

52
00:04:42,18 --> 00:04:45,61
That is a lame excuse. It's a typical guy response.
拜託,這個借口真爛 男生都是這種反應

53
00:04:45,81 --> 00:04:47,78
Do you know how to play?
請問你們誰會玩撲克牌?

54
00:04:48,35 --> 00:04:50,21
No.
不會

55
00:04:51,32 --> 00:04:54,35
-But you could teach us. -No.
-你們可以教我 -不要

56
00:04:59,13 --> 00:05:03,66
Okay,so now we draw cards.
現在開始抽牌

57
00:05:06,30 --> 00:05:08,96
So I wouldn't need any. I have a straight.
我不需要換牌對吧? 因為我一把順

58
00:05:09,17 --> 00:05:12,11
-Oh,good for you! -Congratulations!
-對你來說不錯! -恭喜了!

59
00:05:14,54 --> 00:05:18,38
-Pheebs,how many do you want? -I just need two.
-菲比,你要幾張? -我需要兩張

60
00:05:18,58 --> 00:05:22,17
The 10 of spades and the 6 of clubs.
黑桃十和梅花六

61
00:05:23,35 --> 00:05:26,68
-No,you can't -I have the 10 of spades! Here.
-不,你不能那樣做 -等等,我有你要的黑桃

62
00:05:26,89 --> 00:05:28,48
Thanks!
謝謝!

63
00:05:29,86 --> 00:05:34,49
-No,you can't do that. -Don't need them. I'm going for fours.
-不…不能那樣 -不…可以,我不需要.我要四張同點

64
00:05:34,70 --> 00:05:36,39
Oh,you're
哦,你們

65
00:05:37,67 --> 00:05:42,00
You're going for fours. Chandler,could you? Thanks,man.
我要四張同點.錢德, 你有嗎?謝謝,小伙

66
00:05:47,01 --> 00:05:48,17
Here we go.
開始吧

67
00:05:48,38 --> 00:05:51,47
We've got salmon roulettes and crudites.
我們有鮭魚樂透和水果盤

68
00:05:51,68 --> 00:05:53,51
What are you doing?
摩妮卡,你在幹什麼?

69
00:05:53,72 --> 00:05:57,55
In poker,there's no food with more than one syllable.
撲克裡面,食物的名稱不能超過一個音節

70
00:05:57,75 --> 00:06:01,81
It's got to be like chips or dip or pretz
洋芋片,沙司,椒鹽卷…

71
00:06:03,09 --> 00:06:08,26
I hope you'll let it slide just this once. I was all out of "pretz."
我希望你能只卷這一次

72
00:06:09,73 --> 00:06:10,99
Now the dealer
現在開始發牌

73
00:06:11,20 --> 00:06:14,93
We got it. Let's play for real. High stakes. Big bucks!
知道了.開始玩真的吧.高賭資,大筆錢

74
00:06:15,14 --> 00:06:20,16
You sure? Phoebe just threw away two jacks because they didn't look happy.
你當真?菲比剛丟出十一點(傑克) 因為他們好像不開心

75
00:06:23,85 --> 00:06:26,78
But I'm ready. So just deal.
我準備好了,發牌

76
00:06:26,98 --> 00:06:30,01
Okay,last-minute lesson! Joey....
各位,最後通知!喬伊有

77
00:06:30,22 --> 00:06:31,65
Three.
三點

78
00:06:31,85 --> 00:06:32,84
Eight.
八點

79
00:06:33,42 --> 00:06:36,62
Eight. Three. All right,very good.
八點,三點,好的,不錯

80
00:06:40,66 --> 00:06:42,53
Damn it,damn it,damn it!
該死,該死,該死!

81
00:06:42,73 --> 00:06:46,26
Joey had two fives showing, so for you to raise was
喬伊面上又一對5,該你們叫牌

82
00:06:46,47 --> 00:06:48,16
Yes?
好的?

83
00:06:48,37 --> 00:06:50,63
Downright gutsy.
明顯而且大膽

84
00:06:52,97 --> 00:06:55,97
-I see,so you were lying. -About what?
-我明白,就是騙 -騙什麼?

85
00:06:56,18 --> 00:06:59,34
-About how good your cards were. -I was bluffing.
-騙你們牌有多好 -我在唬你們

86
00:07:00,28 --> 00:07:02,58
And what is bluffing?
什麼是唬?

87
00:07:04,62 --> 00:07:07,82
Is it not another word for lying?
不就是騙的同義字嗎?

88
00:07:08,02 --> 00:07:13,22
Sorry to break up this party,but I've got to go fax resumes before work.
 抱歉,我不能再玩了 我在明天工作前得打好履歷表

89
00:07:13,43 --> 00:07:15,90
-We've got to settle. -Settle what?
-瑞秋,我們得算帳(定居) -什麼定居?

90
00:07:17,50 --> 00:07:20,16
The Jamestown colony of Virginia.
在維吉尼亞的詹姆斯城殖民地

91
00:07:21,84 --> 00:07:24,96
See,King George is giving us the land....
喬治王把土地給我所以…

92
00:07:27,71 --> 00:07:31,87
-The game,Rachel. You owe us money. -Right.
-瑞秋,是賭局,你欠我們錢 -哦,好

93
00:07:32,08 --> 00:07:35,74
It's their first time. Let's forget about the money.
你們知道嗎?這是她們的第一次 別和她們計較錢了

94
00:07:35,95 --> 00:07:38,58
Hell,no. We'll pay!
不好,我們會付錢的

95
00:07:38,79 --> 00:07:42,15
Monica,I had another answer all ready.
摩妮卡,我有另一個答案了

96
00:07:43,49 --> 00:07:46,12
And you know what? We want a rematch.
知道嗎?我們要再來一次

97
00:07:46,33 --> 00:07:49,89
That's fine with me. Could use some money.
不錯,我有錢花了

98
00:07:51,47 --> 00:07:56,46
-You're enjoying this,aren't you? -Well,yeah,I am.
-你很享受這個,是不是 -我想是的

99
00:07:56,90 --> 00:08:01,10
So you get your ya-yas by taking money from your friends.
這麼說你們的組閤家俱 都用朋友的錢買來的

100
00:08:02,71 --> 00:08:05,98
Yes,and I get my ya-yas from KEA.
沒錯,而且我是在「宜家家俱」買的

101
00:08:07,48 --> 00:08:11,54
You have to put them together yourself,but they cost less.
自己得動手裝,便宜許多

102
00:08:12,22 --> 00:08:15,09
Look,this is poker. I play to win.
瑞秋,這是撲克牌,玩就是要贏

103
00:08:15,29 --> 00:08:17,76
For me to win, others have to lose.
為使我能賺錢別人就得輸

104
00:08:17,96 --> 00:08:21,49
If you're gonna play, don't expect me to be nice.
如果想和我玩牌就別指望我手下留情

105
00:08:21,70 --> 00:08:24,63
Because once those cards are dealt....
因為牌一發出

106
00:08:33,81 --> 00:08:35,33
Yeah?
然後呢?

107
00:08:38,51 --> 00:08:41,18
I'm not a nice guy.
我就六親不認

108
00:08:47,52 --> 00:08:49,18
All right,let's eat.
各位,吃吧

109
00:08:49,39 --> 00:08:53,22
Did you get that from the "I Love Rachel Pizzeria"?
這是從「我愛瑞秋匹薩屋」買的嗎?

110
00:08:53,66 --> 00:08:57,50
-You still on that? -What was with that Black Bart speech?
-你們還在取笑我? -別這樣嘛,為何學起黑道

111
00:08:57,70 --> 00:09:01,07
"When I play poker, I'm not a nice guy."
 玩起牌來我六親不認

112
00:09:01,80 --> 00:09:03,24
You're way off.
你扯太遠了

113
00:09:03,44 --> 00:09:07,07
No,I don't think so, because I think you love her!
我可不這麼認為 因為我認為你愛她

114
00:09:07,81 --> 00:09:12,51
No. I might have had feelings for her at one time. Not anymore.
不,或許我曾過她有意思 愛意早已消失

115
00:09:12,71 --> 00:09:13,77
I just
我只是

116
00:09:13,98 --> 00:09:17,31
Marcel! Where are you going with that disk?
馬修!你想把CD片怎麼了?

117
00:09:17,52 --> 00:09:20,01
You are not putting that on again.
不能再放上去,馬修

118
00:09:20,22 --> 00:09:24,18
If you press that button, you are in very big trouble.
如果你們再鬧,你可真的有大麻煩了

119
00:09:55,02 --> 00:09:57,65
You believe what a jerk Ross was being?
你知道羅斯那混蛋有多爛嗎?

120
00:09:57,86 --> 00:10:01,39
-Yeah,I know. -He can get really competitive.
-我懂 -他的好勝心最強了

121
00:10:03,86 --> 00:10:05,30
What?
什麼?

122
00:10:05,73 --> 00:10:08,96
"Hello,kettle? This is Monica. You're black!"
凱蒂,我是摩妮卡,你是黑人

123
00:10:09,17 --> 00:10:11,00
Please!
拜託

124
00:10:13,71 --> 00:10:15,87
I'm not as bad as Ross.
我沒像羅斯那麼爛

125
00:10:16,08 --> 00:10:19,54
I beg to differ. The Pictionary incident?
我抗議,「字典」事件呢?

126
00:10:20,05 --> 00:10:21,84
That wasn't an incident.
我不是故意的

127
00:10:22,05 --> 00:10:26,49
I was gesturing and the plate slipped out of my hand.
我在做手勢時盤子不慎滑落

128
00:10:30,39 --> 00:10:33,79
-I got an interview! -You're kidding! Where?
-他們叫我去面談了! -你在開玩笑吧?哪兒?

129
00:10:34,00 --> 00:10:36,76
Saks Fifth Avenue.
第五大道薩克斯

130
00:10:36,96 --> 00:10:38,66
Oh,Rachel!
哦,瑞秋

131
00:10:39,13 --> 00:10:42,59
It's like the mother ship is calling you home.
這就像是母船叫你歸隊

132
00:10:46,07 --> 00:10:50,07
-What's the job? -Assistant buyer.
-是什麼工作? -採購助理

133
00:10:50,65 --> 00:10:53,08
I would be shopping!
我要用購物…

134
00:10:54,18 --> 00:10:56,65
For a living!
來謀生了

135
00:10:57,99 --> 00:11:01,94
That's Aunt lris. She's been playing poker since she was 5.
她叫艾莉絲姑姑 她從五歲起便開始玩牌

136
00:11:02,16 --> 00:11:05,13
You've got to listen to every word she says.
她說的每字我們都得牢記在心

137
00:11:05,63 --> 00:11:08,53
-ls Tony Randall dead? -I don't think so.
-東尼藍道死了? -我看不是

138
00:11:08,73 --> 00:11:12,39
-He may be now. I hit him with my car. -My God,really?
-現在可能已死因為我開車撞到他了 -天啊…真的?

139
00:11:12,60 --> 00:11:16,06
No,that's bluffing. Lesson number one.
不,唬你們的,第一課

140
00:11:17,44 --> 00:11:22,93
Let me tell you something. Everything you hear at a poker game is pure crap!
告訴你們玩牌聽到的每個字都是狗屁

141
00:11:23,14 --> 00:11:25,64
-Nice earrings. -Thank you.
-不錯的耳環 -謝…

142
00:11:27,88 --> 00:11:32,65
-Girls,sit down. -Aunt lris,this is Phoebe and Rachel.
-坐吧,各位 -艾莉絲姑姑,這位是菲比,她叫瑞秋

143
00:11:32,85 --> 00:11:36,76
Listen,I'm parked at a meter. Let's do it. Okay?
我的車停在計時器前,開始吧

144
00:11:37,63 --> 00:11:40,09
We'll start with five-card draw.
我們從抽五張牌開始

145
00:11:40,29 --> 00:11:46,23
Then we'll go into the studs and the hold 'ems. I talked to Cousin Nathan.
然後我們開始看牌並且持牌. 我跟南希堂兄說

146
00:11:46,43 --> 00:11:49,89
Don't touch the cards when somebody is dealing.
發牌的時候不要碰牌

147
00:11:54,61 --> 00:11:55,70
How is Nathan?
南希怎麼樣?

148
00:11:55,91 --> 00:11:59,47
Now he thinks he's a man in a woman's body.
他現在以為他是一個在女人身體裡的男人

149
00:11:59,68 --> 00:12:02,77
Don't you mean a woman in a man's body?
你是說一個女人在男人的身體裡?

150
00:12:03,22 --> 00:12:05,45
It should be so simple.
這很簡單是吧

151
00:12:16,03 --> 00:12:19,47
Ross,could we please listen to anything else?
羅斯,我們能聽點別的嗎?

152
00:12:19,67 --> 00:12:21,57
All right.
 好吧

153
00:12:37,55 --> 00:12:39,68
I'm gonna pay for that tonight.
我今晚可要倒大楣了

154
00:12:45,16 --> 00:12:47,63
Hi. Guys,guess what?
嗨,夥計們,猜猜看?

155
00:12:47,83 --> 00:12:52,66
The fifth dentist caved,and now they're all recommending Trident?
第五位牙醫投奔他們,推薦「三叉戟」?

156
00:12:58,67 --> 00:13:00,73
No,the interview!
不,是面談

157
00:13:01,18 --> 00:13:04,04
Unbelievable! She absolutely loved me.
簡直無法相信!她喜歡我

158
00:13:04,25 --> 00:13:08,15
We talked for over two hours. We've the same taste in clothes.
我們談了兩個半小時 我們對服飾的品味一致

159
00:13:08,35 --> 00:13:10,78
And I went to camp with her cousin.
我從前還和她的表妹一起去過夏令營

160
00:13:10,99 --> 00:13:15,45
-The job is perfect! I can do this. -That's great!
-這工作簡直是太棒了,我可以勝任 -太好了…

161
00:13:15,66 --> 00:13:19,75
-Then she told a funny story. -Great,tell us and we'll laugh.
-然後她告訴我最好笑的事 -很好,你講時我們一定會笑

162
00:13:19,96 --> 00:13:21,99
Let's play poker!
玩牌吧

163
00:13:23,43 --> 00:13:27,92
Listen,we talked about it and if you don't wanna play,it's okay.
各位聽好,我們談過此事 如果你想不玩我們完全瞭解

164
00:13:28,14 --> 00:13:33,07
Yes,we can play some other game. Like Pictionary?
對,我們可以玩別的像「字典」之類的

165
00:13:34,88 --> 00:13:36,24
Very funny.
真好笑

166
00:13:36,44 --> 00:13:40,47
-But we'd like to try poker again. -Yes,I think we should.
-我們想再給撲克牌一次機會 -我想是的

167
00:13:40,68 --> 00:13:46,38
-Do you want me to shuffle those? -That's okay,I'm gonna give it a go.
-瑞秋,需要我來洗牌嗎? -不用了,我想自己試試

168
00:13:55,23 --> 00:13:58,22
So Pheebs owes $7. 50. Monica owes $10.00.
菲比欠7塊5,摩妮卡欠10塊

169
00:13:58,43 --> 00:14:01,42
And Rachel,you owe 1 5 big ones!
瑞秋,你欠15塊!

170
00:14:02,27 --> 00:14:07,61
Thanks for teaching us Cross-Eyed Mary. We gotta play that other way.
謝謝教我們「斜眼瑪麗」 我們該用另一種方式玩了

171
00:14:08,44 --> 00:14:12,34
All right,here's my $7.50. But this money is cursed.
這是我的7塊5,不過這錢已受到詛咒

172
00:14:12,55 --> 00:14:15,17
-What? -I cursed it!
-什麼? -我已對它下咒!

173
00:14:16,52 --> 00:14:19,38
Now bad things will happen to the spender.
花這些錢的人會倒大楣

174
00:14:19,69 --> 00:14:23,56
I'll take it. Bad things happen to me anyway.
無所謂,我接受.我反正夠楣的了

175
00:14:24,09 --> 00:14:26,99
This way,I can split them up with a movie.
這樣我才能看場電影喘口氣

176
00:14:27,19 --> 00:14:32,50
So that just leaves the big Greene poker machine,who owes 1 5.
才剛離開綠色撲克牌機,誰就欠了15塊

177
00:14:34,00 --> 00:14:36,56
Could you be any smugger?
你能不能不打劫呢?

178
00:14:36,77 --> 00:14:40,37
Let's see. Rach,I'm opening up a new art gallery...
讓我看看.瑞秋,我準備開一個畫廊

179
00:14:40,57 --> 00:14:45,60
...and I could sure use the portraits of Lincoln and Hamilton.
我肯定可以用林肯和漢密爾頓的肖像

180
00:14:47,11 --> 00:14:51,28
It's so typical. "I'm a man! I have a penis!
男生都這副德行 我是男人我有大傢伙

181
00:14:51,49 --> 00:14:55,68
I have to win money to exert my power over women!"
我得贏錢增加力量以征服女人

182
00:14:58,76 --> 00:15:00,28
This isn't over.
知道嗎?還沒結束

183
00:15:00,63 --> 00:15:03,69
We'll play you again. We'll win. You'll lose.
我們會再找你們玩 而且我們會贏你們會輸

184
00:15:03,90 --> 00:15:05,63
You'll beg. We'll laugh.
你們會祈求,我們會大笑

185
00:15:05,83 --> 00:15:11,07
We'll take every last dime you have. And you'll hate yourselves forever!
我們會贏走你們的每一分錢 你們會永遠恨死自己

186
00:15:13,24 --> 00:15:16,33
Kind of stepped on my point there,Mon.
我們的意見一致,摩妮卡

187
00:15:16,54 --> 00:15:19,94
I can't believe you lost! How much did they take?
我無法相信你輸了!有多少?

188
00:15:20,15 --> 00:15:22,05
Like 30 bucks.
差不多30塊

189
00:15:22,25 --> 00:15:24,95
-I'll give you that money back. -Really?
-我會把錢退回去的 -真的嗎?

190
00:15:25,15 --> 00:15:29,05
No,I'm bluffing! You guys haven't learned crap!
不,我在唬你!你們還沒有學偷雞!

191
00:15:31,79 --> 00:15:34,42
-Hand me the cards! -Can l?
-把牌遞給我! -我來行嗎?

192
00:15:34,63 --> 00:15:36,43
Yes!
是的!

193
00:15:42,50 --> 00:15:48,50
Wanna give us your money now? We can skip the formality of really playing.
現在可以交出錢來嗎? 如此我們就不必正式玩了

194
00:15:48,71 --> 00:15:53,04
No,that's fine. We'll see who has the last laugh,monkey boy.
不,我倒要看看誰笑到最後,猴子男

195
00:15:55,95 --> 00:15:59,11
Done with chitchat? Ready for serious poker?
聊完了沒?可以開始玩真的沒?

196
00:15:59,32 --> 00:16:03,42
You guys,look! The one-eyed jack follows me wherever I go.
你們看,獨眼傑克到處跟蹤我

197
00:16:04,69 --> 00:16:06,56
Right. Serious poker.
好,玩真的

198
00:16:06,76 --> 00:16:11,46
-Mon,got any more of those salmon? -You want to eat or play poker?
-摩尼卡,你還有三文魚嗎? -你到底是吃東西還是玩牌?

199
00:16:11,67 --> 00:16:14,83
-Where are you going? -To the bathroom.
-你要上哪兒去? -浴室

200
00:16:15,04 --> 00:16:17,83
Want to go to the bathroom or play poker?
你想上廁所還是玩牌?

201
00:16:18,04 --> 00:16:19,67
Go to the bathroom.
我想上廁所

202
00:16:22,04 --> 00:16:24,64
-Well,I'm gonna order a pizza. -No!
-好吧,我去訂此薩 -不

203
00:16:24,85 --> 00:16:29,75
I'm waiting to hear from that job. The store closes at 9:00. Eat then.
我仍等著工作的電話通知 他們的店在9點關門那時候再吃吧

204
00:16:29,95 --> 00:16:34,15
That's fine. I'll just have a Tic Tac to hold me over.
行,我含薄荷糖提神

205
00:16:34,86 --> 00:16:39,19
All right. Cincinnati. No blinds. Everybody,ante.
未見牌不得下注,下注吧

206
00:16:39,39 --> 00:16:40,38
Yes!
下…

207
00:16:41,60 --> 00:16:43,53
Or no.
不下

208
00:16:45,40 --> 00:16:50,50
-All right! Your money's mine,Greene. -Your fly's open,Geller.
-你的錢是我的了,菜鳥 -你的拉鏈沒拉上,蓋勒

209
00:16:56,41 --> 00:17:02,41
You know what I just realized? Joker is poker with a "J"!
我剛剛才瞭解到,十一點上有個J

210
00:17:04,75 --> 00:17:06,22
Coincidence?
真巧?

211
00:17:07,49 --> 00:17:11,39
That's jo-incidence with a "C"!
那是J碰巧和一個C在一起

212
00:17:21,97 --> 00:17:25,20
-Phoebe? -Yeah,I'm out.
-菲比? -我不跟了

213
00:17:26,24 --> 00:17:28,87
-I'm in. -Me too.
-我跟 -我也跟

214
00:17:29,08 --> 00:17:30,94
Me too. What do you got?
我也跟,你拿什麼牌?

215
00:17:31,61 --> 00:17:36,35
You better hop out of the shower, because I got a flush.
你最好逃出浴室 因為我拿五張同花(沖馬桶)

216
00:17:39,25 --> 00:17:40,88
Well,well,well!
好的,好的,好的!

217
00:17:41,16 --> 00:17:45,92
Hop back in,bucko, because I got four sixes!
回來吧,小子,因為我拿了四張六

218
00:17:46,16 --> 00:17:50,19
I got four sixes! I won! I actually won! Oh,my God!
我有四張六!我贏了… 我真的贏了,天哪

219
00:17:50,40 --> 00:17:53,49
You know what? I'll make a little Ross pile.
你們知道嗎?我要把小羅斯堆起來

220
00:17:53,70 --> 00:17:54,86
Look!
看!

221
00:17:55,07 --> 00:17:59,97
I think that one was Ross'. And I think that one was Ross'.
我想這是羅斯的 那個也是羅斯的

222
00:18:01,38 --> 00:18:05,24
Well,I have got your money And you'll never see it
我賺到你的錢,你再無法見到它

223
00:18:05,45 --> 00:18:07,71
And your fly's still open
你的拉鏈依然沒拉上

224
00:18:07,95 --> 00:18:09,92
I made you look
我讓你低頭看了

225
00:18:12,79 --> 00:18:15,38
-I'm in. -I couldn't be in-er.
-我跟 -我不能跟

226
00:18:15,59 --> 00:18:18,18
Monica,in or out?
摩妮卡,跟還不跟?

227
00:18:18,59 --> 00:18:20,69
I hate this game!
我討厭玩牌

228
00:18:28,54 --> 00:18:29,97
Joey,your bet.
喬依,你呢?

229
00:18:30,17 --> 00:18:33,40
I fold like a hooker who got hit in the stomach...
我像是被滿臉傷痕的胖子

230
00:18:33,67 --> 00:18:36,64
... by a fat guy with sores on his face.
撞到肚子的二流妓女

231
00:18:40,15 --> 00:18:41,38
I'm out.
我不跟

232
00:18:42,92 --> 00:18:46,08
-Ross? -I'm very in.
-羅斯? -我跟

233
00:18:46,72 --> 00:18:48,98
-Chandler? -Couldn't be more out.
-錢德? -不跟

234
00:18:49,19 --> 00:18:51,99
Me too. Rachel?
我也一樣,瑞秋?

235
00:18:52,39 --> 00:18:58,39
I will see you and I'll raise you. Do you wanna waste another buck?
我不但跟而且還要加注 如何?還想再浪費錢嗎?

236
00:18:59,33 --> 00:19:02,10
No,not this time. What did you have?
這一回不會.快嘛,給我看

237
00:19:02,30 --> 00:19:04,20
-I'm not telling. -Show them.
-我不會說的 -給我看

238
00:19:04,40 --> 00:19:05,46
-No. -Show them!
-不 -給我看

239
00:19:05,67 --> 00:19:09,77
-Get your hands out of there! -I've had dates like this.
-把你的手從那裡拿開! -我有同樣的約會經驗

240
00:19:11,98 --> 00:19:15,04
Boy,you really can't stand to lose,can you?
天啊,你真是輸不起的傢伙

241
00:19:15,32 --> 00:19:20,58
Your whole face is getting red. Veins popping out of your temple!
你的臉漲得好紅 太陽穴的小血管都浮出來了

242
00:19:20,79 --> 00:19:24,15
Plus,that shirt doesn't really match those pants.
而且衣褲並不相稱

243
00:19:27,96 --> 00:19:31,29
-I'm not losing. -You're definitely losing.
-第一,我沒輸 -別再談輸了,快發牌吧你輸定了

244
00:19:31,50 --> 00:19:33,47
Hello. Rachel Greene.
瑞秋格林

245
00:19:35,34 --> 00:19:38,20
Excuse me. It's about the job!
這是有關工作的電話

246
00:19:38,81 --> 00:19:41,14
Barbara,hi! How are you?
芭芭拉,你好嗎?

247
00:19:45,95 --> 00:19:48,24
No,I understand.
不,我懂

248
00:19:49,75 --> 00:19:54,02
Come on. No,I'm fine. Don't be silly. Yeah.
不,我沒事,快別這麼說

249
00:19:54,22 --> 00:19:57,99
But if anything else opens up,please
是否還有其他職缺請人?

250
00:19:58,19 --> 00:19:59,82
Hello?
你好?

251
00:20:17,98 --> 00:20:19,17
Sorry,Rach.
我很遺憾,瑞秋

252
00:20:19,68 --> 00:20:22,62
There's gonna be lots of other stuff.
工作滿街都是

253
00:20:22,82 --> 00:20:24,34
Okay.
好的

254
00:20:25,29 --> 00:20:27,19
Where were we?
Where were we? 玩到哪兒了?

255
00:20:28,02 --> 00:20:33,76
Five-card draw. Jacks are better. Nothing wild. Everybody,ante.
拿五張牌,十一點比較好,大家下注

256
00:20:34,63 --> 00:20:39,36
-Look,Rach,we don't have to do this. -Yes,we do.
-瑞秋,別再玩了 -要玩,下注

257
00:20:41,67 --> 00:20:43,76
-All right. Check. -Check.
-好吧,下注 -下注

258
00:20:44,14 --> 00:20:47,27
-I'm in for 50 cents. -Call.
-我下5毛錢 -跟跟

259
00:20:47,47 --> 00:20:49,27
I'm in.
我跟

260
00:20:49,68 --> 00:20:52,27
I see your 50 cents...
我跟你5毛

261
00:20:52,48 --> 00:20:55,97
...and I raise you $5.
而且我要加5塊錢

262
00:20:56,82 --> 00:20:59,15
I thought it was a 50-cent limit.
我以為5毛是上限

263
00:20:59,35 --> 00:21:02,29
I just lost a job, I'd like to raise it $5.
我剛失去工作所以想加5塊

264
00:21:02,49 --> 00:21:04,96
Does anyone have a problem with that?
各位有問題嗎?

265
00:21:05,53 --> 00:21:07,72
-Not at all. -No.
-當然沒有 -沒有

266
00:21:11,90 --> 00:21:13,42
Loser?
輸家?

267
00:21:21,31 --> 00:21:25,18
-No,I fold. -What do you mean,you fold?
-退出 -退出是什麼意思?怎麼了?

268
00:21:25,41 --> 00:21:29,82
I thought that,"Once the cards are dealt,I'm not a nice guy."
你不是發牌後就六親不認的狠角色嗎?

269
00:21:30,05 --> 00:21:32,64
Were you just full of it?
還是只是虛張聲勢?

270
00:21:45,77 --> 00:21:46,82
I'm in.
我跟

271
00:21:47,67 --> 00:21:49,83
-How many do you want? -One.
-幾張牌? -一張

272
00:21:51,34 --> 00:21:53,27
Dealer takes two.
莊家兩張

273
00:21:53,64 --> 00:21:56,58
-What do you bet? -I bet $2.
-下多少? -我下2塊

274
00:21:58,21 --> 00:22:01,11
Okay. I see your $2...
我跟你2塊

275
00:22:01,32 --> 00:22:04,05
...and I raise you...
再加你

276
00:22:05,32 --> 00:22:07,01
... 20.
20塊

277
00:22:11,83 --> 00:22:13,69
I see your $20...
我跟你20塊

278
00:22:14,76 --> 00:22:16,79
... raise you $25.
再加到25塊

279
00:22:22,24 --> 00:22:26,37
I see your $25 and Monica,get my purse.
跟你25塊,摩妮卡,拿我的皮包來

280
00:22:32,11 --> 00:22:34,71
Rachel,there's nothing in it.
瑞秋,裡面沒錢

281
00:22:35,78 --> 00:22:38,27
Okay,then get me your purse.
那就拿你的皮包來

282
00:22:43,29 --> 00:22:46,19
-Here you go. Good luck! -Thank you.
-給你.祝你好運! -謝謝

283
00:22:46,69 --> 00:22:50,25
I saw your $25 and I raise you...
謝謝,跟你25塊,再加

284
00:22:50,80 --> 00:22:52,79
...seven.
…7塊

285
00:22:53,37 --> 00:22:54,93
teen!
10塊!

286
00:23:02,98 --> 00:23:05,50
Joey,I'm a little shy.
喬伊,我有點不好意思

287
00:23:05,88 --> 00:23:09,04
That's okay,Ross. You can ask me.
沒問題,你有什麼問題可以問我

288
00:23:14,99 --> 00:23:16,96
-What do you need? -1 5.
-要多少? -15塊

289
00:23:17,16 --> 00:23:19,09
-Here's 10. -I got 5.
-這裡有10塊 -我這裡有5塊

290
00:23:19,29 --> 00:23:21,39
-Thank you. -Good luck.
-謝謝 -好運氣

291
00:23:22,40 --> 00:23:25,13
I am calling your 1 7.
再加十七塊

292
00:23:25,33 --> 00:23:27,16
What do you got?
你拿什麼牌?

293
00:23:37,74 --> 00:23:39,84
Full house.
葫蘆

294
00:23:46,22 --> 00:23:47,85
You got me.
敗給你了

295
00:23:58,50 --> 00:24:01,30
-That's tough to beat. -I thought we had it!
-那確實很難贏 -我因為我們會贏!

296
00:24:01,50 --> 00:24:05,40
When you don't have the cards, you don't have the cards.
沒有好牌就是沒有好牌

297
00:24:05,61 --> 00:24:08,04
But look how happy she is.
瞧,她多開心

298
00:24:17,92 --> 00:24:20,82
-Airmail. -Airplane. Airport. Airport '75!
-航空郵件 -飛機.機場,機場75

299
00:24:21,02 --> 00:24:24,25
Airport '77! Airport '79!
機場77,機場79

300
00:24:24,86 --> 00:24:26,45
Time's up!
時間到

301
00:24:26,66 --> 00:24:29,29
Bye Bye Birdie!
再見…小鳥

302
00:24:31,13 --> 00:24:33,22
That's a bird?
那是小鳥?

303
00:24:33,43 --> 00:24:35,77
That's a bird!
那就是小鳥!

304
00:24:36,47 --> 00:24:38,94
Okay,it's my turn.
該我了

305
00:24:40,44 --> 00:24:41,87
Go!
開始

306
00:24:44,08 --> 00:24:46,51
Bean! Bean!
豆子!豆子!

307
00:24:47,95 --> 00:24:50,42
The Unbearable Lightness of Being!
生命中無法承受的輕

308
00:24:53,69 --> 00:24:55,38
That you get?
答對了

309
00:24:55,59 --> 00:24:57,85
That you get?!
這樣就能猜中…

310
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


311
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


